  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Four Gu Immortals reach the periphery of the Crazed Demon formation in the ninth layer of Crazed Demon Cave. The formation sits as high as rank nine. Gu Immortals advance alone across truthful floating ice pieces of different sizes and shapes, because each person sees and feels the ice differently.",
      "chapters": [
        2189
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "loc_crazed_demon_cave"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Limitless Demon Venerable planned with Star Constellation Immortal Venerable and dragged the Gu cultivation world into creating the Crazed Demon formation, preparing for a million years.",
      "chapters": [
        2209
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_limitless_demon_venerable",
        "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Derivation Immortal Gu was once obtained by Limitless Demon Venerable and used as the core of this formation.",
      "chapters": [
        2274
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The place that holds the formation is covered on Crazed Demon Cave.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the worlds in the eighth layer merge into one, they disappear and turn into clues and energy for the formation’s derivation. Carving the central truthful floating ice is meant to find the method of eternal life.",
      "chapters": [
        2189
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "derivation-goal",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Star Constellation Immortal Venerable later accelerates the formation. She calls Limitless’s setup astonishing and at the peak of the world, notes that he was a rule path Gu Immortal rather than wisdom path, and states that she already controls half the formation. Under her influence the formation’s form changes and derivation efficiency rises. Peripheral truthful floating ice thaws while the central piece expands, until only one piece would remain with the truth of eternal life carved on it.",
      "chapters": [
        2195
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "derivation-goal",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The formation’s core is easy to enter and difficult to exit. Forcefully breaking out risks destroying the central truthful floating ice and ruining the million-year derivation.",
      "chapters": [
        2195
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "core-and-final-stretch",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan and Immortal Zombie Giant Sun return to the formation later, only thirty percent of it remains. The eternal life research results derived over a million years are the prize at stake.",
      "chapters": [
        2198
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "core-and-final-stretch",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_immortal_zombie_giant_sun"
      ]
    }
  ],
